OL,3,GNEWSAEmily Atack backs call for school
OL,4,Auniform ban in porn
OL,5,
OL,6,FActress Emily Atack has supported for
OL,7,Fcalls for the government to ban the use
OL,8,Fof school uniforms in pornography.
OL,10,FThe campaign was started by a group of
OL,11,Fteenage girls from The Cooper School in
OL,12,FBicester who say uniforms have been
OL,13,F"tarnished... and warped by
OL,14,Fsexualisation".
OL,16,FTheir petition has been signed more
OL,17,Fthan 40,000 times and comes in response
OL,18,Fto new government legislation making it
OL,19,Fa criminal offence to possess or share
OL,20,Fpornographic content featuring adults
OL,21,Fpretending to be under 16.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,338,330,200,160,0,100
