OL,3,GNEWSAEmily Atack backs call for school
OL,4,Auniform ban in porn
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the students say the new law does
OL,7,Fnot go far enough and a "loophole"
OL,8,Fmeans uniforms could be worn by those
OL,9,Fclaiming to be playing someone over 16.
